            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lillian J"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved the recipe. Instead of butter, I used equal parts bacon grease and olive oil. My mother loved it. I’m adding this recipe to my family recipe book. Thank you so much for the recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2023-01-22T18:14:12.853Z"
