              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bob"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a pretty good recipe as it is. I heated some whole mustard seed in the bacon fat until it broke open then added a mix of roasted curry powder and crushed red pepper. Excellent!",
            "datePublished": "2018-06-06T01:04:48.577Z"
