            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "keebdaisy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was so good! I too used the bacon grease instead of butter. To cook the asparagus more even, I cut them in half and cooked the lower halves about 5 mins and then added the top halves. I didn't have a shallot so I chopped up some green onions. They worked well. Made sure you use real shredded parm cheese, not the bottle kind. It makes it even better.",
            "datePublished": "2017-04-09T18:39:30.743Z"
          },
          {
