            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CAcooking"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was so easy! I actually cooked the crumbled bacon, shredded the Parmesan &amp; sliced shallots in the morning. I cooked it right up when the guests were sitting down to dinner. Hubba ! Hubba! The guy who didn’t like vegetables had two helpings. Success!",
            "datePublished": "2020-10-25T01:45:30.590Z"
          },
          {
