            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jeanne Flowers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent! I cut my stalks in half, and started the bottom halves cooking first. After 8 minutes, they were barely warm. I cooked it all about another 5-10 minutes and they were still crispy yet tender. I added a splash of fresh lemon juice at the end. My husband doesn’t like asparagus very much, but he loved this! Thanks for the recipe.",
